'''Cutter Cat''' is a [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 8.0 Update|Version 8.0]] and can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 10.6 Update|Version 10.6]] grants increased attack power and [[Immune to Waves|Wave Immunity]]. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], Cutter Cat was added in [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.4 Update|Patch 1.0.4]] and could be unlocked by purchasing the Package Version Bonus in either '''Japanese''' ('''JP''') or '''Southeast Asia''' ('''SEA''') versions.

