==Trivia==
*Prior to [[Version 11.2 Update|Version 11.2]], Cutter Cat, [[Driller Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Driller Cat]], [[Piledriver Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Piledriver Cat]], [[Backhoe Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Backhoe Cat]] and [[Miter Saw Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Miter Saw Cat]] could only be unlocked when "Grandon Mining Corps" was part of the current pool.
*Cutter Cat's Japanese name, Sentai Chokindosu, is a reference to one of [[PONOS Corporation|PONOS]]' other games, ''[https://youtu.be/qTw6-uwHa48 Buta no Chokindosu!]''.
*Cutter Cat could be seen in [[Mighty Thermae D-Lux (Uber Rare Cat)|Subterra Guardians]]' attack animation before it was added to the game, albeit with a darker color scheme, a shank of meat instead of a fish, and the number "03" instead of "08".
**In the Ultra Form, [[Mighty Thermae D-Lux (Uber Rare Cat)|Subterra Saviours]], a conceptual Ultra Form design for Cutter Cat, along with all other Grandon Mining Corps units can be seen during its attack animation. They have the same color scheme of all other [[Frontline Assault IRON LEGION (Gacha Event)|IRON LEGION]] Ultra Forms, that being red and black with gold lining.
*In The Battle Cats Unite!, Cutter Cat was nerfed as their Immune to Weaken ability was removed.

